OL,3,GNEWSADate proposed for controversial
OL,4,Anew red route
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses are calling on Brighton &
OL,7,FHove City Council to change course
OL,8,Fafter it announced when a "red route"
OL,9,Fwill be introduced on a vital
OL,10,Fthoroughfare.
OL,12,FReconstruction and resurfacing work,
OL,13,Fexpected to take 45 days, is due to
OL,14,Fbegin on Western Road from 28
OL,15,FSeptember, with stopping banned after
OL,16,Fthe project completes.
OL,18,FAlastair Gourlay, owner of Real
OL,19,FPatisserie on the route, said the
OL,20,Frestrictions would be "detrimental to
OL,21,Ftrade, maybe to jobs, and unnecessary".
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
